OL,3,AUS firefighters say major blaze near
OL,4,AReno about a quarter contained
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS fire crews have reported progress in
OL,7,Ftheir efforts to tackle a large
OL,8,Fwildfire menacing the city of Reno,
OL,9,FNevada - saying the blaze is about a
OL,10,Fquarter contained.
OL,12,FThe Hawk Fire, which began on Saturday,
OL,13,Fhad spread over 15,000 acres by Monday,
OL,14,Ffirefighters said.
OL,16,FEvacuation orders remain in place for
OL,17,F23,000 people, though other residents
OL,18,Fhave now been allowed to return to
OL,19,Ftheir homes. Tens of thousands of other
OL,20,Fresidents have been told to be ready to
OL,21,Fleave at any moment.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
