OL,3,AUS firefighters say major blaze near
OL,4,AReno about a quarter contained
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials are concerned that gusts of
OL,7,Fwind could drive the flames towards
OL,8,Fmore homes. Unfavourable weather
OL,9,Fconditions are forecast for the next
OL,10,Ftwo days, meaning the fire could
OL,11,Fcontinue to burn during that timeframe.
